{
    "talkId": "6986201",
    "total_dialogue_lines": 31,
    "speaker_counts": {
        "Player": 13,
        "Yanfei": 18
    },
    "dialogues": [
        {
            "id": "698620101",
            "speaker": "Yanfei",
            "text": "Hmm..."
        },
        {
            "id": "698620102",
            "speaker": "Player",
            "text": "Yanfei! Long time no see."
        },
        {
            "id": "698620103",
            "speaker": "Yanfei",
            "text": "#Well well, if it isn't {NICKNAME}. It's been a while for sure. Didn't expect to see you in Nod-Krai.",
            "choices": [
                {
                    "id": "698620104",
                    "text": "So, what brings you here?",
                    "response": [
                        {
                            "id": "698620106",
                            "speaker": "Yanfei",
                            "text": "Hahaha, if only! Nod-Krai's even more lawless than I could've imagined."
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "698620107",
                            "speaker": "Yanfei",
                            "text": "How should I put it... Well, that's just it. This place is quite literally \"a lawless land.\""
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "698620108",
                            "speaker": "Yanfei",
                            "text": "Even if I was hired to provide legal assistance, I suspect it'd all devolve into... everyone resorting to the \"Final Defense Manifesto\" to air their grievances."
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "698620109",
                            "speaker": "Player",
                            "text": "A \"Final Defense Manifesto\"...?"
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "698620110",
                            "speaker": "Yanfei",
                            "text": "Ta-da. Here's your answer. The most direct method of self-defense."
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "698620111",
                            "speaker": "Player",
                            "text": "Oh, so that's why it's a mani-\"fist\"-o..."
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "698620112",
                            "speaker": "Yanfei",
                            "text": "Haha, okay, enough of that. The reason I came to Nod-Krai is to gather material for the new legal guidebook I'm co-authoring with Shinobu."
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "698620113",
                            "speaker": "Yanfei",
                            "text": "The book's theme centers on the \"borders of law,\" and one of its chapters is about what happens when law and order completely breaks down."
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "698620114",
                            "speaker": "Yanfei",
                            "text": "There's no way I'd be able to get an accurate picture of that back in Liyue, so here I am... this infamous land of lawlessness."
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "698620115",
                            "speaker": "Yanfei",
                            "text": "As soon as I stepped into Nod-Krai, I knew I was in the right place. It's not like the law here has \"broken down.\" It's more like it never existed at all."
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "698620116",
                            "speaker": "Yanfei",
                            "text": "And unsurprisingly... I haven't run into a single person in my line of work. Being a legal consultant here is probably an easy way to starve.",
                            "choices": [
                                {
                                    "id": "698620117",
                                    "text": "Are you on your own?",
                                    "response": [
                                        {
                                            "id": "698620119",
                                            "speaker": "Yanfei",
                                            "text": "Hey, don't worry. I've got adeptus blood, remember? Ordinary bandits can't even scratch me."
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "698620120",
                                            "speaker": "Yanfei",
                                            "text": "In fact, I'm kind of waiting for someone to come and accost me... Then I can drag them aside and interview them on how they survive in such a hostile place.",
                                            "choices": [
                                                {
                                                    "id": "698620121",
                                                    "text": "I didn't expect Madame Ping would agree to this...",
                                                    "response": [
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "698620123",
                                                            "speaker": "Yanfei",
                                                            "text": "Hmm? Ah... Ahaha! Yeah... You have no idea! I spent so long convincing her to let me leave, I'm sure my horns grew out a little...",
                                                            "choices": [
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "698620124",
                                                                    "text": "Wait a moment.",
                                                                    "response": [
                                                                        {
                                                                            "id": "698620126",
                                                                            "speaker": "Yanfei",
                                                                            "text": "Why, yes! We talked it through! I... I definitely did..."
                                                                        },
                                                                        {
                                                                            "id": "698620127",
                                                                            "speaker": "Player",
                                                                            "text": "And she definitely said \"yes,\" right?"
                                                                        },
                                                                        {
                                                                            "id": "698620128",
                                                                            "speaker": "Yanfei",
                                                                            "text": "Yes? Yeah, yes... Yeah! Granny just loves me to bits, you know, and we spoke for ages..."
                                                                        },
                                                                        {
                                                                            "id": "698620129",
                                                                            "speaker": "Yanfei",
                                                                            "text": "Anyway, I'd love to stay and chat, but I've got an appointment! With... uh, the \"Curatorium of Secrets,\" that's it! So, without further ado, I'll be getting a move on!"
                                                                        },
                                                                        {
                                                                            "id": "698620130",
                                                                            "speaker": "Player",
                                                                            "text": "Yanfei!"
                                                                        },
                                                                        {
                                                                            "id": "698620131",
                                                                            "speaker": "Yanfei",
                                                                            "text": "See you! Bye!"
                                                                        }
                                                                    ]
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "698620125",
                                                                    "text": "Yanfei, you DID talk this through with Madame Ping, yes?"
                                                                }
                                                            ]
                                                        }
                                                    ]
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "698620122",
                                                    "text": "I thought she'd give you something to defend yourself with..."
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        }
                                    ]
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "698620118",
                                    "text": "That seems dangerous..."
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "id": "698620105",
                    "text": "I don't suppose you're here to give someone legal assistance..."
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}